@startuml seq-07-helper-code-delegate
' Zangbundel BLE protocol, document v0.11, protocol 1.0 - sections 8.4, 9.4, 9.8, 10.12
' Scenario 7: the leader makes a singer a delegate with a helper code; the delegate acts; revocation.
' Render: java -jar plantuml.jar -charset UTF-8 -tsvg seq-07-helper-code-delegate.puml   (run again with -tpng: PlantUML uses only the last -t flag)

title BLE 7 – Appoint a delegate (assistent) with a helper code\nble-protocol.md v0.12, sections 8.4, 9.4, 9.8, 10.12

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI, Roboto, sans-serif"
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #0B2545
skinparam ActorBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam ActorBorderColor #0B2545
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #CFE6FF
skinparam NoteBorderColor #13315C
skinparam SequenceGroupBorderColor #FF8A3D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFF4EA
skinparam ArrowColor #13315C

actor "Leader (person)" as U
participant "Leader app" as L
participant "Air\n(broadcast)" as AIR
participant "Helper's app\n(registered singer)" as D
actor "Helper (person)" as H

== Appoint ==
U -> L : drawer → "Assistent toevoegen"  [guiDesign D-61, D-73]
L -> L : hc = 4 random digits, valid 120 s or until used,\none code at a time  [10.12]
L -> U : show hc large on the leader's screen
U -> H : reads the code aloud / shows the screen (out of band)
H -> D : songlist sheet → "Assistent worden", types hc (assistentcode)  [guiDesign D-73]
D -> L : connect; write Control 0009 = 0x01 ‖ seal_ek{tok, cid, op 9, hc, gid}  [9.8, 8.4]
L -> L : open with ek; token known? hc equals the valid code?
alt hc correct
  L -> L : add sid to dlg, consume hc, seq + 1, ts ↑, sign  [9.4]
  L --> D : write response: success
  L -> AIR : beacon seq; burst: new state record  [7.4]
  AIR --> D : state frames → verified: own sid is in dlg  [FR-LEAD-45]
  D -> H : banner "De leider heeft je assistent gemaakt";\ntab "Leiden" appears  [guiDesign D-46]
  D -> L : Transfer 0005 = 0x01 ‖ seal{doc 8, tok, gid}  [9.7]
  L --> D : Data: HEADER enc 2, DATA (sealed to xk), END → request list with names
  L -> U : drawer lists the delegate by display name, with "Intrekken"  [guiDesign D-73]
else hc wrong, expired, or locked
  L --> D : error 0x8E; wrong-try counter + 1  [8.3]
  D -> H : "Code onjuist of verlopen"
  note right of L : After 3 wrong tries, or 120 s, the code is dead:\nevery further op 9 gets 0x8E until the leader\nshows a new code. One try per 2 s per connection.
end
D -> L : disconnect (or keep "stay" if granted)  [8.2, 10.8]

== Act as delegate ==
H -> D : "Nu zingen" on a song in the Leiden tab  [guiDesign D-46]
D -> L : connect; Control {tok, cid, op 1 push song, ref} sealed  [9.8]
L -> L : apply as if done on the leader's screen; seq + 1; sign  [FR-LEAD-43]
L -> AIR : beacon seq; burst: state + song
L -> U : leader's page updates: "wordt gezongen"  [FR-LEAD-45]
alt leader unreachable
  D -> H : "De leider is niet bereikbaar, probeer het straks opnieuw";\nnot queued  [FR-LEAD-43, guiDesign D-46]
end

== Revoke (leader only) ==
U -> L : "Intrekken" next to the delegate  [FR-LEAD-44]
L -> L : remove sid from dlg, seq + 1, sign  [10.12]
L -> AIR : burst: new state
AIR --> D : state → own sid no longer in dlg
D -> H : banner; tab "Leiden" disappears  [FR-LEAD-45]
D -> L : (any later Control op 1–8) → 0x89 not a delegate  [8.3]
note over L, D : A delegate that leaves (op 10) is removed from dlg by the leave itself.\nThe role survives a temporary loss of contact: dlg is in the signed state  [FR-LEAD-46].
@enduml
